WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Cards spend elixir as timed attacks continue.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Health, shields and attack timers update during the exchange.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:28.000
New cards enter the hand as elixir is spent and replenished.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:38.170
The remaining enemy takes damage while the hand stays available.

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:45.800
Victory presents three reward cards. This run selects Radiant Ward.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:56.920
Choose a reachable branch on the map.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.650
Travel to the selected Opportunity.

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:04.100
The Opportunity reveal cycles through its possible outcomes.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:09.400
Hidden Spring restores 19 HP: 181 to 200.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:16.600
The map returns with 200 HP and the Opportunity node completed.
